      "sentence": "However, it lacks concrete details on what specific advantage to highlight or how to structure the explanation.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "把 5 分所需的“知道如何执行”过度解释为必须规定解释结构和具体优势点；原文已通过“第一行相对第二行/已有工作 [2,3,4] 的优势”给出明确修改方向。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The second part, \"I suggest comparing the generalized gaps with different $A^{(k)}_{norm}$,\" is also explicit but vague, as it does not specify which $A^{(k)}_{norm}$ values to use or how to present the comparison.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "该建议明确给出比较对象 generalized gaps 和变化因素 different $A^{(k)}_{norm}$，足以让作者直接做对比实验；理由额外要求取值清单和呈现格式，抬高了具体性门槛。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, the comment fits the description of score 3: an explicit action that is vague on how to execute it.",
      "error_type": "score_mapping_error",
      "explanation": "前文已认定为 explicit action，且评论指向明确可执行的补充解释与对比实验；将其映射到“明确但执行模糊”的 3 分，与真实标签 5 的档位含义不匹配。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "有害样本中 CoT 的核心错误是过度苛求执行细节，把已足够明确具体的可行动评审降级为 3，因此其证据主要支持错误分数。"
